{"id":"e9b28c9ef17c93bd","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-hs-ideal.md","title":"低 c.e. 度并非理想：原断言的反例","display":"thm-hs-ideal — 低 c.e. 度并非理想：原断言的反例","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-hs-ideal","aliases":["20-thm-hs-ideal"],"display":"thm-hs-ideal — 低 c.e. 度并非理想：原断言的反例","chapter":"7","section":"7.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"corrected-counterexample","source_reference":"Corollary 7.5.4；原错误断言的反证","source_pdf_pages":[193],"source_printed_pages":[159],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-low-ce-generate]]","[[20-thm-jump]]","[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-redeg]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-hs-ideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-hs-ideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hs-ideal — 低 c.e. 度并非理想：原断言的反例"},{"key":"chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"section","html":"7.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"corrected-counterexample"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 7.5.4；原错误断言的反证"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>193</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"db07d4693484f246\" href=\"?note=db07d4693484f246\" title=\"20-thm-low-ce-generate\">20-thm-low-ce-generate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_1\">\\(L_1\\)</span> 为低度族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"db07d4693484f246\" href=\"?note=db07d4693484f246\" title=\"20-thm-low-ce-generate\">20-thm-low-ce-generate</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hs\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\mathbf0&#39;\\notin L_1].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hs\\text{-}ideal}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in L_1\\cap\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf a\\vee\\mathbf b=\\mathbf0&#39;\\notin L_1].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 应用低分裂。其跳跃 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;&gt;\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;&gt;\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 不低。原所谓 Harrington–Soare low ideal 断言缺少真实来源且直接失败；本文件改为可证反例，不冒充另一条 Harrington–Soare 定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 7.5.4；原错误断言的反证；印刷页 159；PDF 第 193 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-low-ce-generate","status":"resolved","id":"db07d4693484f246","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-low-ce-generate]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-low-ce-generate","status":"resolved","id":"db07d4693484f246","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-ce-generate]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-ce-generate]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-low-ce-generate]]；